00:51:59.370 --> 00:52:01.200
but there's some people in
the House that are just like,

00:52:01.200 --> 00:52:04.470
how does this person become

00:52:04.470 --> 00:52:07.140
a national politician, a representative?

00:52:07.140 --> 00:52:08.910
And then you go even lower than that,

00:52:08.910 --> 00:52:11.463
and you get into like state legislators.

00:52:13.230 --> 00:52:14.063
Yeah.

00:52:14.063 --> 00:52:15.270
It can get pretty freewheeling.

00:52:15.270 --> 00:52:18.570
The people who make a
series of life decisions,

00:52:18.570 --> 00:52:20.430
where they find themselves in a position

00:52:20.430 --> 00:52:24.987
to run for local office, you know,

00:52:26.820 --> 00:52:30.120
this isn't necessarily the
best and the brightest.

00:52:30.120 --> 00:52:32.400
I mean, I'm not, I'm just saying.

00:52:32.400 --> 00:52:34.230
I'm just saying that.

00:52:34.230 --> 00:52:37.590
But those elections, that those people

00:52:37.590 --> 00:52:39.720
are actually really, really important.

00:52:39.720 --> 00:52:42.780
So when it comes to
the mayor of your town,

00:52:42.780 --> 00:52:45.030
I guess it's one thing to
say like Mayor of Los Angeles

00:52:45.030 --> 00:52:49.530
or Burbank, but like just a
mayor of your average town,

00:52:49.530 --> 00:52:51.000
Like that's a really important,

00:52:51.000 --> 00:52:53.050
I think it's a really important position.

00:52:54.060 --> 00:52:55.110
You know what I'm saying?

00:52:55.110 --> 00:52:55.943
Yeah.

00:52:55.943 --> 00:52:57.780
I'm a little too intimidated
to sign up for that,

00:52:57.780 --> 00:53:00.090
even in a small town.

00:53:00.090 --> 00:53:02.790
Seems like, I don't know.

00:53:02.790 --> 00:53:04.540
I couldn't see you doing it either.

00:53:05.910 --> 00:53:08.640
Well I mean, I jokingly talk

00:53:08.640 --> 00:53:10.803
about political campaigns all the time,

00:53:12.275 --> 00:53:15.780
because I'm, I have just
enough blind confidence

00:53:15.780 --> 00:53:17.670
to get to a place where I
feel like I've got something

00:53:17.670 --> 00:53:21.270
to say and could motivate somebody.

00:53:21.270 --> 00:53:23.730
And maybe I could believe
in something enough

00:53:23.730 --> 00:53:26.250
where I felt like, you
know, political will

00:53:26.250 --> 00:53:28.173
was the most important part of it.

00:53:29.280 --> 00:53:33.990
But I'm never gonna
allow myself to do that.

00:53:33.990 --> 00:53:35.130
Do you have a recommendation?

00:53:35.130 --> 00:53:36.690
I do.

